{"abstract":[{"text":"Answer a web page’s request for an mdoc over the Digital Credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API, as an iOS document provider.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentingtosafari"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari"},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Presenting to Safari","anchor":"Presenting-to-Safari","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"From iOS 26, a page in Safari can ask for an ISO mdoc with the W3C"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Digital Credentials API, using the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"org-iso-mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol (ISO\/IEC TS"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"18013-7 Annex C). iOS offers the apps that registered a matching"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document, and shows the chosen app’s document provider extension for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the holder’s consent. The extension answers through"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startMdocPresentation(requestData:origin:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/respond(document:credentialID:elements:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"; the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"response goes back through Safari, encrypted to the page, with no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"network request from the wallet."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Safari sends only "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"org-iso-mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":", not OpenID4VP, and on iOS only:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Safari on macOS has no document providers."}]},{"text":"Set up the app and its extension","anchor":"Set-up-the-app-and-its-extension","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The extension:"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" a target whose Info.plist names the extension"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"point "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.identity-document-services.document-provider-ui"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EXAppExtensionAttributes"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EXExtensionPointIdentifier"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The capability:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Digital Credentials API – Mobile Document"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provider, on both the app’s and the extension’s App IDs, with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doctypes the app presents in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"com.apple.developer.identity-document-services.document-provider.mobile-document-types","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entitlement. Apple allows only certain doctypes, such as the ISO mDL"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and Photo ID."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shared storage:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" the extension is another process, so the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps its credentials in an App Group both list"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), and its holder keys in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a Keychain access group both list"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"). Instance and DPoP"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keys stay in the app’s own group: the extension presents, but doesn’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"receive. The app saves its configuration where the extension can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read it too."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","import IdentityDocumentServices","import IdentityDocumentServicesUI","import OID4VCWallet","import SwiftUI","","\/\/\/ What the app and its document provider extension share.","enum SharedWallet {","    static let appGroup = \"group.com.example.wallet\"","    static let holderKeyGroup = \"ABCDE12345.com.example.wallet.shared\"","","    \/\/\/ The configuration the app saved in the group's defaults.","    static func configuration() throws -> WalletConfiguration {","        guard let data = UserDefaults(suiteName: appGroup)?.data(forKey: \"configuration\") else { throw CocoaError(.fileNoSuchFile) }","        return try JSONDecoder().decode(WalletConfiguration.self, from: data)","    }","","    \/\/\/ The wallet over the shared store and holder keys: the app passes","    \/\/\/ its Wallet Provider; the extension, which only presents, nil.","    static func open(provider: (any WalletProvider)?) throws -> Wallet {","        try Wallet(","            configuration: try configuration(),","            keyStore: KeychainKeyStore(options: .init(holderAccessGroup: holderKeyGroup)),","            credentialStore: try FileCredentialStore.inAppGroup(appGroup),","            provider: provider)","    }","}"]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Register the documents","anchor":"Register-the-documents"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS offers the app only for documents it registered. Whenever the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials change, register each presentable mdoc and remove the rest."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"supportedAuthorityKeyIdentifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" names the reader CAs, by subject key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier, whose requests the document answers."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Registers the held mdocs of `doctypes` with iOS, so Safari offers the","\/\/\/ app for them. The first registration asks the holder to allow it.","@available(iOS 26.0, *)","func registerDocuments(_ credentials: [CredentialSummary], doctypes: Set<String>, readerAuthorities: [Data]) async throws {","    let store = IdentityDocumentProviderRegistrationStore()","    for registration in try await store.registrations {","        try await store.removeRegistration(forDocumentIdentifier: registration.documentIdentifier)","    }","    for credential in credentials where credential.format == \"mso_mdoc\" && doctypes.contains(credential.doctype ?? \"\") {","        try await store.addRegistration(MobileDocumentRegistration(","            mobileDocumentType: credential.doctype ?? \"\",","            supportedAuthorityKeyIdentifiers: readerAuthorities,","            documentIdentifier: credential.id,","            invalidationDate: credential.validUntil))","    }","}"]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Answer in the extension","anchor":"Answer-in-the-extension"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS hands the extension the request in two stages. First,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestContext.request"},{"type":"text","text":" describes what’s asked,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the consent screen: show it with the website’s origin, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"candidates from "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/mdocCandidates(origin:)"},{"type":"text","text":". Only when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder shares does iOS release the request itself, to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sendResponse"},{"type":"text","text":"‘s closure. Validate it there, parse it, check it’s what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the holder was shown, and answer."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["@available(iOS 26.0, *)","struct WalletDocumentProvider: IdentityDocumentProvider {","    var body: some IdentityDocumentRequestScene {","        ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestScene { context in","            ConsentView(context: context)","        }","    }","","    func performRegistrationUpdates() async {}","}","","struct RequestChanged: Error {}","","@available(iOS 26.0, *)","struct ConsentView: View {","    let context: ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestContext","","    var body: some View {","        Button(\"Share\") { Task { try await share(credentialID: nil) } }","    }","","    \/\/\/ Shares the held mdoc `credentialID` (the first candidate when","    \/\/\/ nil) for the request's first document.","    func share(credentialID: String?) async throws {","        guard let originURL = context.requestingWebsiteOrigin,","              let origin = MdocPresentation.origin(of: originURL) else { return }","        let wallet = try SharedWallet.open(provider: nil)","        try await context.sendResponse { raw in","            _ = try IdentityDocumentWebPresentmentRawRequestValidator()","                .validateISO18013MobileDocumentRequest(raw.requestData, origin: originURL)","            let presentation = try await wallet.startMdocPresentation(requestData: raw.requestData, origin: origin)","            guard let document = presentation.request.documents.first,","                  let chosen = credentialID ?? document.credentials.first?.id else { throw RequestChanged() }","            \/\/ The holder key signs now: Face ID, if the key store asks.","            let response = try await presentation.respond(document: 0, credentialID: chosen, elements: document.elements)","            return ISO18013MobileDocumentResponse(responseData: response.response)","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A real consent screen compares the released request with what it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"showed — the same document, elements and reader — and refuses one that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changed. The demo wallet’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DocumentProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" target does this in full."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Name the reader","anchor":"Name-the-reader"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A page’s request may be signed by its reader’s certificate (ISO\/IEC"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"18013-5 reader authentication). When the certificate chains to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Request-swift.struct\/reader"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"names it; otherwise show only the website’s origin."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRequireEKU"},{"type":"text","text":" accepts only certificates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issued for readers, and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses requests from any other reader before the holder sees them."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Warn of linkable presentations","anchor":"Warn-of-linkable-presentations"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each candidate’s "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/linkableHere"},{"type":"text","text":" says whether"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presenting it would hand this website a copy another website has seen,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Response\/linkable"},{"type":"text","text":" whether it did. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"extension doesn’t refresh used-up copies: have the app do it when it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next becomes active, after listing its credentials again."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"role":"article","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Presenting to Safari"},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/startMdocPresentation(requestData:origin:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/startmdocpresentation(requestdata:origin:)","title":"startMdocPresentation(requestData:origin:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"startMdocPresentation","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"requestData","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","text":"Data"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"origin"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MdocPresentation","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet16MdocPresentationC","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startMdocPresentation(requestData:origin:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Parses an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"org-iso-mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":" request — an mdoc asked for over the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Digital Credentials API, as iOS hands one to a document provider"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"extension — and finds the held mdocs that can answer it.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"requestData","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IdentityDocumentWebPresentmentRawRequest.requestData"},{"type":"text","text":";"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"origin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" the requesting page’s origin","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":"ISO18013MobileDocumentRequestContext.requestingWebsiteOrigin","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as "},{"code":"MdocPresentation.origin(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" serializes it."}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/requireTrustedMdocReader":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/requiretrustedmdocreader","title":"requireTrustedMdocReader","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Refuses an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"org-iso-mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":" request no recognized reader signed:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"startMdocPresentation","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" throws "},{"code":"untrustedVerifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and nothing is","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"shown to the holder. Needs ","type":"text"},{"code":"mdocReaderRoots","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requireTrustedMdocReader","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth."}],"title":"OID4VCWallet","role":"collection","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/MdocPresentation/respond(document:credentialID:elements:)":{"title":"respond(document:credentialID:elements:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Presents the held mdoc "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"credentialID"},{"type":"text","text":" for document number"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"document"},{"type":"text","text":", disclosing exactly "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"elements"},{"type":"text","text":", each one it requested."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The holder key signs now, so a key store requiring user presence"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"prompts."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"respond"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"document"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"credentialID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"elements"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet16MdocPresentationC7ElementV","text":"Element"},{"kind":"text","text":"]) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet16MdocPresentationC8ResponseV","text":"Response"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/respond(document:credentialID:elements:)","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/mdocpresentation\/respond(document:credentialid:elements:)"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/MdocPresentation/Request-swift.struct/reader":{"abstract":[{"text":"The subject common name of the reader that signed the request,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when its certificate chains to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"WalletConfiguration.mdocReaderRoots","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; “” when the holder can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"only be shown "},{"code":"origin","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"title":"reader","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reader","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/Request-swift.struct\/reader","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/mdocpresentation\/request-swift.struct\/reader"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/mdocCandidates(origin:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/mdocCandidates(origin:)","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/mdoccandidates(origin:)","title":"mdocCandidates(origin:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The held mdocs, each with whether the page at "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origin"},{"type":"text","text":" has been"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shown it and whether presenting it there now would be linkable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"shownToVerifier"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"linkableHere"},{"type":"text","text":"): for a document provider’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consent screen, shown before iOS releases the request itself."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MdocPresentation.request"},{"type":"text","text":" says the same once it has."}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mdocCandidates","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"origin","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"CredentialSummary","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet17CredentialSummaryV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/mdocReaderRequireEKU":{"title":"mdocReaderRequireEKU","abstract":[{"text":"Recognizes only reader certificates with the ISO\/IEC 18013-5","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reader authentication extended key usage (1.0.18013.5.1.6), so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"certificate issued for another role under ","type":"text"},{"code":"mdocReaderRoots","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"isn’t taken for a reader’s.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"mdocReaderRequireEKU"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRequireEKU","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/mdocreaderrequireeku"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialSummary/linkableHere":{"title":"linkableHere","abstract":[{"text":"Whether presenting it to the Verifier asking would hand it a copy","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"another Verifier has seen. Set only on a presentation’s candidates.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragment